3"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-04T13:11:48-07:00","id":859207,"title":"","content":"I still have to wait till next month, no money, I spent it on Beast instead. But I do like what I heard about the Grimm's fluff, so its on the list still, along with Mage 2e and if it comes out in time, Secrets of the Covenants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 04-04-2016, 04:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-04T13:17:08-07:00","id":859211,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/855890-dark-eras-for-us?p=859177#post859177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For what its worth from what I've heard about it, the fluff sounds great, but I choose to buy Beast this month, so buying Dark Eras will have to wait till next month, but hopefully that will give you guys time to address any mechanical issues.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've put it elsewhere, but just to make sure everyone's on the same page, the issues people are bringing up as mechanical issues are things I was specifically instructed to do, and I haven't yet been instructed to change anything. That's not to say I won't be. But I started a lot of these same conversations when my drafts were being written and I thought I needed to clarify the instructions I was given.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-04T13:29:46-07:00","id":859220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/855890-dark-eras-for-us?p=859177#post859177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For what its worth from what I've heard about it, the fluff sounds great, but I choose to buy Beast this month, so buying Dark Eras will have to wait till next month, but hopefully that will give you guys time to address any mechanical issues.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also. Should anyone be curious. I also wrote for the Beast Dark Era. One of two writers there.<br /> <br /> And I exclusively wrote the Beast Ready-Made PCs.<br /> <br /> I've been really worried about how my writing would be received, but I'm getting nearly all positives for my work on Grimm. I just hope that continues.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_