oin Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-20T22:45:23-07:00","id":869956,"title":"","content":"So, as one of these damn dirty no good awful none backers, can I ask a question? What are changelings up to in the Sundered World? I ask because I'm curious if Iron (big &quot;I&quot; iron) has cursed the Fae yet. Gauging whether the act had anything to do with the actual Iron Age as such or not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-20T23:08:51-07:00","id":869965,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/855890-dark-eras-for-us?p=869956#post869956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, as one of these damn dirty no good awful none backers, can I ask a question? What are changelings up to in the Sundered World? I ask because I'm curious if Iron (big &amp;quot;I&amp;quot; iron) has cursed the Fae yet. Gauging whether the act had anything to do with the actual Iron Age as such or not.</div> </div> </div> </div> We don't know much beyond the fact that sometimes people disappear, and sometimes something that looks normal except to the Wise comes back, pleading that the person they say they are is really an imposter. ArcaneArts has some musings though that we've seen snippets of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-21T14:09:24-07:00","id":870612,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/855890-dark-eras-for-us?p=869956#post869956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, as one of these damn dirty no good awful none backers, can I ask a question? What are changelings up to in the Sundered World? I ask because I'm curious if Iron (big &quot;I&quot; iron) has cursed the Fae yet. Gauging whether the act had anything to do with the actual Iron Age as such or not.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hmm... now I kind of wish that we had some kind of early iron age Dark Era; maybe a Hittite one or, better yet, one set in the wake of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Late_Bronze_Age_collapse\" target=\"_blank\">late bronze age collapse</a>. A Greek &quot;dark age&quot; setting would be neat, with wandering Rhapsodes carrying oral epics between small, walled poleis, bringing some measure of hope and structure to the scattered and fearful Lost.<br /> <br /> One neat wrinkle would be if, in the Chronicles of Darkness world, the spread of iron weaponry in place of bronze were motivated in part by the metal's power against the fey. After all, from a purely mundane standpoint bronze is a superior material for arms and armor when compared to un-alloyed iron; the advantage of the latter is largely that iron is much more abundant than tin, which is essential for bronze making. And yet, the iron age ultimately spread even to places that had well-established local sources of tin, which in the CoD may have been motivated the supernatural properties of the metal.<br /> <br /> Could be a worthy fan project.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3209,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","user":"CatDoom","date":". 04-23-2016, 02:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","name":"CatDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-21T21:50:13-07:00","id":870928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/855890-dark-eras-for-us?p=869956#post869956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, as one of these damn dirty no good awful none backers, can I ask a question? What are changelings up to in the Sundered World? I ask because I'm curious if Iron (big &amp;quot;I&amp;quot; iron) has cursed the Fae yet. Gauging whether the act had anything to do with the actual Iron Age as such or not.</div> </div> </div> </div>No mention of iron. I think it's more interesting if that contract having not been broken yet means significant metaphysical differences for the fae and changelings. Specifically I would leave the rise of the &quot;escapee&quot; narrative and the resulting birth of the Courts till the dawn of the Iron Age. Instead, given my druthers I'd focus on this era on children sacrificed to the elements rather than kidnapped, and them returning as emissaries of divinities the community that sacrificed them are now oath bound too.<br /> <br /> [my intent here is an inversion on the real world dark origin of Changeling myths. Instead of disabled children being impostors left by the fae, it's the often-disabled children abandoned to the elements who are the ones returning]<br /> <br /> Use the Huntsmen as separate menaces dominant in power over the proto-Gentry on Earth, and protecting mortals who uphold their oaths to the gods from the Hunt's predations is one of the main things Changelings do. Huntsmen don't take captives - they're older than domestication. They take the skins and fates of their prey and wear them to continue the Hunt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T09:06:24-07:00","id":879544,"title":"","content":"So, is Dark Eras actually available for purchase yet, or is it only backers who've gotten their advance PDF releases making these comments? I ask because these threads make me intensely interested in adding this to my collection, but I don't know where to find it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5487-voiddrifter","name":"VoidDrifter","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T09:32:40-07:00","id":879560,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>VoidDrifter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/855890-dark-eras-for-us?p=879544#post879544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, is Dark Eras actually available for purchase yet, or is it only backers who've gotten their advance PDF releases making these comments? I ask because these threads make me intensely interested in adding this to my collection, but I don't know where to find it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Only backers. Errata is collected, so OP is now editing the files before releasing them to the general public. Given how huge the book is, it may take a while.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}